t time were Bos Angkunh, Leak Kanseng, Sdach Jong, Teanh Prot, Krong Me Moan, etc. The aesthetic value of all these games is based on the ideals embedded in the games by Khmer ancestors to reflect the realities of life of the ancient Khmer people at that time, along with many folk legends that have been narrated from mouth to mouth. <br \/>Can you guess what games will be played on Songkran Day at the Camtech University?<\/p><p>Do not forget to join our activity and make your guess for a chance to win prizes from our team.<\/p><p>To participate in this activity, each individual needs to follow three easy conditions as below: <br \/>1. Like the official Facebook page of Camtech University, <br \/>2. Mention at least 3 friends,<br \/>3. Share this announcement publicly.<\/p><p>The winners will be announced on April 7, 2022.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-cd48afe elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-gap-beside-yes elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-column-vertical-align-stretch\" data-id=\"cd48afe\" data-element_type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-extended\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-ae8f053\" data-id=\"ae8f053\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-d9f71d7 elementor-widget elementor-widget-spacer\" data-id=\"d9f71d7\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"spacer.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer-inner\"><\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\